---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/ui/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const UPDATED = 'October 12, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — What We Collect | SolutionsNepal"
  description="SolutionsNepal privacy: calculators run in your browser with no accounts. Analytics measures visits; the contact form sends only what you type."
>
  <div class="legal-wrap">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />

    <header class="legal-hero">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-lede">What we collect (very little), what never leaves your browser, and how to reach us.</p>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {UPDATED}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="legal-section" aria-label="Summary">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">The short version</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li><strong>No accounts, no sign-ups.</strong> There is nothing to log into, so we hold no usernames, passwords, or profiles.</li>
        <li><strong>Calculator inputs stay on your device.</strong> Salary, loan, tax, and converter numbers are processed in your browser and never sent to us.</li>
        <li><strong>We measure visits with Google Analytics</strong> to learn which pages help people. Blockers stop it entirely — the site works fine without it.</li>
        <li><strong>The contact form sends only what you type</strong> (name, email, message) so we can reply.</li>
        <li><strong>Questions or deletion requests:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@solutionsnepal.com">hello@solutionsnepal.com</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section" aria-label="Data that stays in your browser">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">What stays in your browser</h2>
      <div class="legal-prose">
        <p>Every calculator, converter, and checker on SolutionsNepal runs as client-side code. When you type a salary, pick dates, or upload a photo for resizing, compressing, or PDF work, that data is processed locally on your device. It is not uploaded, logged, or stored on any server we operate.</p>
        <p>Two exceptions, both only on your explicit action:</p>
        <ul class="legal-list">
          <li><strong>English ↔ Nepali translator</strong> — the text you translate is sent to a translation service to produce the result. It is not stored by us.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact form</strong> — covered below.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Your dark/light theme choice is saved in your own browser's local storage so the site remembers it. We cannot see it.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section" aria-label="Analytics">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Analytics</h2>
      <div class="legal-prose">
        <p>We use Google Analytics on every page to understand aggregate usage — which pages are visited, roughly from where, and on what kind of device. This helps us decide what to build and fix. Google Analytics sets its own cookies (such as <code>_ga</code>) and processes data under Google's policies.</p>
        <p>You can opt out at any time: use an ad/tracker blocker, enable Do-Not-Track, or install Google's Analytics opt-out extension. The site works fully with analytics blocked.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section" aria-label="Contact form">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Contact form</h2>
      <div class="legal-prose">
        <p>If you write to us through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, your name, email address, and message are transmitted via our form provider (Web3Forms) to our team inbox so we can reply. We use messages only to respond and improve the site, and we never sell or share them. Please do not send citizenship numbers, passwords, bank credentials, or other sensitive personal data through the form.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section" aria-label="Live rates and cookies">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Live rates, cookies &amp; third parties</h2>
      <div class="legal-prose">
        <p>Gold, fuel, currency, and weather figures shown on the site are fetched from official public sources (Nepal Rastra Bank, FENEGOSIDA, Nepal Oil Corporation, Open-Meteo) when the site updates. No personal data of yours is sent to those sources.</p>
        <p>Fonts and article cover images are hosted on this site — loading a page does not contact Google Fonts or image CDNs. Apart from Google Analytics cookies above, we set no cookies of our own: no login or session cookies.</p>
        <p>Pages link out to official Nepali government and public sites (such as ird.gov.np or dotm.gov.np). Once you follow those links, their privacy policies apply, not this one.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section" aria-label="Children and changes">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Children &amp; changes</h2>
      <div class="legal-prose">
        <p>SolutionsNepal is a general-audience reference site. We do not knowingly collect data from children, and because there are no accounts, there is no child profile to create or delete.</p>
        <p>If this policy changes, the new version will be posted here with a revised date. Continued use of the site after a change means you accept the updated policy.</p>
        <p>For any privacy question — including asking what (if anything) we hold about you — email <a href="mailto:hello@solutionsnepal.com">hello@solutionsnepal.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-wrap {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 28px 24px 96px;
  }
  .legal-hero { margin: 6px 0 30px; }
  .legal-title {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--nk-text);
  }
  .legal-lede {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    color: var(--nk-text-secondary);
  }
  .legal-updated {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--nk-accent);
    background: var(--nk-accent-subtle);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--nk-accent) 25%, transparent);
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }
  .legal-section { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .legal-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .legal-h2 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--nk-text);
  }
  .legal-prose p {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--nk-text-secondary);
  }
  .legal-prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .legal-prose a { color: var(--nk-accent); }
  .legal-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .legal-prose .legal-list { margin-top: 4px; }
  .legal-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 22px;
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--nk-text-secondary);
  }
  .legal-list li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--nk-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .legal-list strong { color: var(--nk-text); }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .legal-wrap { padding: 20px 20px 64px; }
  }
</style>
